The dependencies (FastPFOR, streamvbyte) built once, in Release, with no debug:
upstream builds each twice, RelWithDebInfo (-O2 -g) and Debug (no optimization),
unless DISTR_BUILD is set, and the Release build of the port linked their Debug
build. DISTR_BUILD itself turns on more (the packaging of a distribution).

--- cmake/external-build.cmake.in.orig
+++ cmake/external-build.cmake.in
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@
 
 include ( ExternalProject )
 
-set ( DEVMODE @DISTR_BUILD@ )
+set ( DEVMODE 1 )
 
 set ( BUILD_TYPE @CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE@ )
 if (NOT BUILD_TYPE)
